    "title": "NKY coroner Mark Schweitzer dies; replacement to be appointed - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WKRC ,\n6 hours ago CAMPBELL COUNTY, Ky. (WKRC) - Campbell County Coroner Mark Schweitzer has died, the Kentucky Coroners Association said. Schweitzer passed away on Thursday. Funeral arrangements are pending at Dobbling, Muehlenkamp-Erschell Funeral Home in Bellevue, Kentucky. Because of Schweitzer’s death, a judge-executive will appoint his replacement. Read full article",
